# Webview Development Rules

## Webview Creation

- Create webview panels with proper lifecycle management
- Use retainContextWhenHidden for state preservation
- Implement proper disposal in onDidDispose
- Handle webview visibility changes appropriately
- Use enableScripts only when necessary

## HTML Content

- Embed HTML content inline in TypeScript files
- Use VSCode CSS variables for theming integration
- Implement responsive design with CSS Grid/Flexbox
- Ensure accessibility with proper ARIA attributes
- Use semantic HTML structure

## JavaScript Communication

- Use acquireVsCodeApi() for extension communication
- Implement message passing with structured data
- Handle message validation and sanitization
- Use proper event listeners with cleanup
- Implement timeout handling for async operations

## Security Considerations

- Sanitize user input before processing
- Validate message data structure
- Use Content Security Policy when needed
- Avoid eval() or similar dangerous functions
- Implement proper error boundaries

## Performance Optimization

- Minimize DOM manipulation
- Use efficient event delegation
- Implement lazy loading for heavy content
- Cache expensive operations
- Use requestAnimationFrame for animations

## Error Handling

- Provide user-friendly error messages
- Implement graceful fallbacks
- Log errors for debugging
- Handle network failures appropriately
- Show loading states for async operations

## VSCode Integration

- Use VSCode theme variables consistently
- Implement proper keyboard navigation
- Follow VSCode UX guidelines
- Use appropriate icons and styling
- Ensure proper focus management

